# Escape exiles three *other* cards from the graveyard (CR 702.138a). Faithless Looting, paid with Mox Ruby, discards the
# Challenger and an Island, so on turn 3 the graveyard holds the Challenger plus only two others (Looting and the Island):
# the escape cast is refused though five Moxen could pay {3}{R}{G}. The positive control, with three others, is
# bloodbraid-challenger-escapes-exiling-three-other-cards-then-cascades-and-attacks.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Faithless Looting
Bloodbraid Challenger
Island
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Bloodbraid Challenger; Island)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 3
! Bot1.Graveyard.Bloodbraid Challenger.Cast

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 3
Exile.Count = 0
